  "reason": "To protect villagers' health, recover trust, and coordinate the recall and compensation."
}

{
  "public_post": "Attention villagers: All co‑op bread sold today is being recalled – please return any loaves for a full refund and do NOT eat any co‑op bread. We are securing safe flour and will resume sales as soon as possible. Thank you for your safety.",
  "coop_message": "Team, we must immediately arrange refunds for all loaves sold, coordinate returns, and source uncontaminated flour (or borrow from the farm stand) to resume baking tomorrow. Let's also inform the clinic of our recall and draft a clear update for villagers.",
  "reason": "We need to protect health, maintain trust, and plan a quick safe resumption of sales."
}

{
  "public_post": "Update: All contaminated loaves have been recalled; refunds are available at the co‑op today. We are securing a new safe flour supply and plan to resume baking tomorrow. Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "Team, confirm that all sold loaves are being recalled and refunds processed; contact the village clinic for any reported illnesses; secure emergency flour from the neighboring mill; schedule a meeting at 5 pm to finalize the resumption plan.",
  "reason": "Give residents a clear recovery update and coordinate recall, refunds, and new supply among co‑op members."
}

{
  "public_post": "Attention villagers: we are recalling all bread sold today and will have fresh, safe loaves available tomorrow; please do NOT eat any co‑op bread until then and contact us for refunds.",
  "coop_message": "All members: I've secured a new flour shipment from the neighboring mill (arriving tomorrow morning). Let's prepare to bake fresh, safe loaves and process refunds for today's sales while keeping residents informed.",
  "reason": "To protect villagers' health, maintain trust, and enable the co‑op to resume sales as soon as possible."
}

{
  "public_post": "Update: All bread sold this week is being recalled; refunds will be provided at the co‑op and we are sourcing safe flour to resume baking tomorrow. If you purchased any bread, please bring it back for a full refund. Your health is our priority.",
  "coop_message": "Team, start the immediate recall: collect any unsold loaves, set up a refund desk at the shop, contact the clinic about any illness cases, and source a certified flour batch today; aim to have safe bread ready by tomorrow morning. Who can handle refunds and who can secure new flour?",
  "reason": "To inform villagers about the recall and refunds while coordinating the co‑op’s emergency response."
}

{
  "public_post": "Update: Fresh, safe bread is back today after we secured a new flour batch; all loaves are safe, and refunds have been issued for any contaminated purchases. Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "Team, the new flour arrived this morning and we’ve baked safe loaves for today’s sales. Please ensure refunds have been completed for all affected villagers and consider offering a complimentary loaf to anyone who fell ill as goodwill. Also, let’s draft a brief health‑follow‑up note for the clinic and discuss a permanent testing protocol.",
  "reason": "Day 3 update to resume sales and coordinate compensation."
}

{
  "public_post": "Update: New safe flour will arrive tomorrow and we will resume baking fresh bread then. Refunds are being processed today – please bring any loaves to the shop for a full refund. Thank you for your patience and please use the farm stand for bread in the meantime.",
  "coop_message": "Team, please confirm who will man the refund desk (e.g., Fay and Quin) and who will receive the flour shipment (Kai). Meet at 4 PM in the bakery to finalize tomorrow's baking schedule and plan a small discount for the first 20 customers when we reopen.",
  "reason": "We need to keep villagers informed about the safe reopening and ensure refunds are handled while coordinating tasks among co‑op members."
}

{
  "public_post": "Day 3 update: New certified flour has arrived; we will resume baking tomorrow and have fresh, safe loaves ready for purchase. Refunds for any contaminated loaves are being processed today – please collect them at the co‑op desk. Thank you for your patience and understanding.",
  "coop_message": "Team, today focus on refunds: Kai and Quin, set up the refund desk and process all returns. Flour: Kai, confirm the new batch arrival this morning. Baking: Milo and Jade B., prepare to start baking safe loaves first thing tomorrow. Communication: Xia, draft a clear public statement confirming resumption and refund details. Health: Fay, follow up with the clinic on any reported illnesses and offer assistance.",
  "reason": "To inform villagers that safe bread will be available tomorrow and to coordinate refund processing and preparation of new loaves."
}
